  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"They have many affairs, and they have many dreams and schemes and great talk and they have no thought for their father.\"",
  "[action] The second son goes out to the fields.",
  "[action] The eldest son goes out to the fields.",
  "[says] Wang Lung's sons are preoccupied with their own ambitions.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung asks his son why he doesn't eat rice.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and why do you not eat rice?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I do not eat rice because I have a wife now, and she has rice enough for me and for her.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits in the sun.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and we have many affairs and many schemes, and we have our wives and our dreams and we have no thought for our father.\"",
